# Lesson Resources 

#### Everything you need to deliver engaging and effective classes is included with each **lesson plan** to help make your teaching experience as seamless as possible.

<img src="https://images.code.org/7cd9f66961e3f7ce51e78ba95fc1d9c9-Screenshot 2025-12-02 at 3.07.43 PM.png" alt="A lesson plan diagram uses arrows to show where objectives, teaching guides, slides, and student handouts are" width="60%" style="border-radius:10px; float:right; margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: 3px solid black;">



